{"script": "１２月２４日（木）_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 0, "page": 0, "status": "needs_review", "speaker": {"chs": null, "steam": null}, "alt_speaker": {"chs": null, "steam": null}, "voice": {"chs": null, "steam": null, "equal": false}, "text": {"chs": "在那之后……", "steam": "那之後……"}, "length": {"chs": 6, "steam": 5}, "similarity": 0.571}
{"script": "１２月２４日（木）_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 1, "page": 0, "status": "aligned", "speaker": {"chs": "纱凪", "steam": "紗凪"}, "alt_speaker": {"chs": null, "steam": "紗凪"}, "voice": {"chs": "sn6762", "steam": "sn6762", "equal": true}, "text": {"chs": "「呼、呼、再、再怎么说也够了吧，\\n　全身酥酥麻麻的而且也很害羞……」", "steam": "「嗯呼、嗯呼、真、真的夠了啦、很癢，而且很羞恥……」"}, "length": {"chs": 35, "steam": 26}, "similarity": 0.44}
{"script": "１２月２４日（木）_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 2, "page": 0, "status": "needs_review", "speaker": {"chs": null, "steam": null}, "alt_speaker": {"chs": null, "steam": null}, "voice": {"chs": null, "steam": null, "equal": false}, "text": {"chs": "我们就这样脱了衣服洗了个澡，\\n然后直接钻进了被窝。", "steam": "我們脫下衣服清理身體，然後躺到床上依偎彼此。"}, "length": {"chs": 26, "steam": 22}, "similarity": 0.182}
{"script": "１２月２４日（木）_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 3, "page": 0, "status": "needs_review", "speaker": {"chs": null, "steam": null}, "alt_speaker": {"chs": null, "steam": null}, "voice": {"chs": null, "steam": null, "equal": false}, "text": {"chs": "然后，我温柔地抱住了纱凪，\\n开始专心摸起她的头来。", "steam": "我溫柔地抱著紗凪，撫摸著她的頭。"}, "length": {"chs": 26, "steam": 16}, "similarity": 0.432}
{"script": "１２月２４日（木）_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 4, "page": 0, "status": "needs_review", "speaker": {"chs": null, "steam": null}, "alt_speaker": {"chs": null, "steam": null}, "voice": {"chs": null, "steam": null, "equal": false}, "text": {"chs": "——至少现在得对她温柔些。", "steam": "──聊勝於無，倒也不是。"}, "length": {"chs": 13, "steam": 12}, "similarity": 0.0}
{"script": "１２月２４日（木）_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 5, "page": 0, "status": "needs_review", "speaker": {"chs": "新吾", "steam": "新吾"}, "alt_speaker": {"chs": null, "steam": "新吾"}, "voice": {"chs": null, "steam": null, "equal": false}, "text": {"chs": "「嘴上这么说，却一点也不抵抗呢，纱凪」", "steam": "「雖然那樣說，但妳沒有抵抗呢，紗凪。」"}, "length": {"chs": 19, "steam": 19}, "similarity": 0.276}
{"script": "１２月２４日（木）_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 6, "page": 0, "status": "aligned", "speaker": {"chs": "纱凪", "steam": "紗凪"}, "alt_speaker": {"chs": null, "steam": "紗凪"}, "voice": {"chs": "sn6763", "steam": "sn6763", "equal": true}, "text": {"chs": "「还不是因为我被某人给迷得神魂颠倒了啊」", "steam": "「因為不知道是被誰弄得神魂顛倒嘛。」"}, "length": {"chs": 20, "steam": 18}, "similarity": 0.485}
{"script": "１２月２４日（木）_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 7, "page": 0, "status": "aligned", "speaker": {"chs": "纱凪", "steam": "紗凪"}, "alt_speaker": {"chs": null, "steam": "紗凪"}, "voice": {"chs": "sn6764", "steam": "sn6764", "equal": true}, "text": {"chs": "「而且你一副很想摸的样子……\\n　我只是无可奈何，才让你摸的♪」", "steam": "「而且新吾看起來很想摸的樣子……我是沒辦法才讓你摸的喔♪」"}, "length": {"chs": 32, "steam": 29}, "similarity": 0.549}
{"script": "１２月２４日（木）_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 8, "page": 0, "status": "aligned", "speaker": {"chs": "纱凪", "steam": "紗凪"}, "alt_speaker": {"chs": null, "steam": "紗凪"}, "voice": {"chs": "sn6765", "steam": "sn6765", "equal": true}, "text": {"chs": "「……很舒服，而且让人安心」", "steam": "「……反正很舒服，又很放鬆。」"}, "length": {"chs": 14, "steam": 15}, "similarity": 0.333}
{"script": "１２月２４日（木）_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 9, "page": 0, "status": "aligned", "speaker": {"chs": "纱凪", "steam": "紗凪"}, "alt_speaker": {"chs": null, "steam": "紗凪"}, "voice": {"chs": "sn6766", "steam": "sn6766", "equal": true}, "text": {"chs": "「啊……疼疼疼」", "steam": "「欸……好痛痛痛！」"}, "length": {"chs": 8, "steam": 10}, "similarity": 0.0}
{"script": "１２月２４日（木）_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 10, "page": 0, "status": "needs_review", "speaker": {"chs": "新吾", "steam": "新吾"}, "alt_speaker": {"chs": null, "steam": "新吾"}, "voice": {"chs": null, "steam": null, "equal": false}, "text": {"chs": "「啊……纱凪、难道说……」", "steam": "「啊……紗凪、該不會……」"}, "length": {"chs": 13, "steam": 13}, "similarity": 0.429}
{"script": "１２月２４日（木）_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 11, "page": 0, "status": "aligned", "speaker": {"chs": "纱凪", "steam": "紗凪"}, "alt_speaker": {"chs": null, "steam": "紗凪"}, "voice": {"chs": "sn6767", "steam": "sn6767", "equal": true}, "text": {"chs": "「抱歉……怎么说呢，身体稍微恢复了点力气，\\n　就不由得会注意到那里……」", "steam": "「抱歉……感覺身體好像恢復力氣了，結果好像連那裡都想起來……」"}, "length": {"chs": 37, "steam": 31}, "similarity": 0.269}
{"script": "１２月２４日（木）_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 12, "page": 0, "status": "needs_review", "speaker": {"chs": "新吾", "steam": "新吾"}, "alt_speaker": {"chs": null, "steam": "新吾"}, "voice": {"chs": null, "steam": null, "equal": false}, "text": {"chs": "「……要道歉的是我啊」", "steam": "「……是我該說抱歉。」"}, "length": {"chs": 11, "steam": 11}, "similarity": 0.462}
{"script": "１２月２４日（木）_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 13, "page": 0, "status": "aligned", "speaker": {"chs": "纱凪", "steam": "紗凪"}, "alt_speaker": {"chs": null, "steam": "紗凪"}, "voice": {"chs": "sn6768", "steam": "sn6768", "equal": true}, "text": {"chs": "「没什么好道歉的吧。刚刚也说过了，\\n　我们是互相都希望如此才做的」", "steam": "「你不用道歉沒關係。就像我剛才說的，這是我們都想做的事。」"}, "length": {"chs": 34, "steam": 29}, "similarity": 0.34}
{"script": "１２月２４日（木）_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 14, "page": 0, "status": "aligned", "speaker": {"chs": "纱凪", "steam": "紗凪"}, "alt_speaker": {"chs": null, "steam": "紗凪"}, "voice": {"chs": "sn6769", "steam": "sn6769", "equal": true}, "text": {"chs": "「女孩子第一次会痛是很正常的，\\n　也没办法啊」", "steam": "「女孩子的第一次會痛是自然的生理現象，沒辦法。」"}, "length": {"chs": 24, "steam": 24}, "similarity": 0.5}
{"script": "１２月２４日（木）_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 15, "page": 0, "status": "needs_review", "speaker": {"chs": null, "steam": null}, "alt_speaker": {"chs": null, "steam": null}, "voice": {"chs": null, "steam": null, "equal": false}, "text": {"chs": "……不过，要是我做得不那么激烈。", "steam": "……但是，如果我沒有那麼激烈的話。"}, "length": {"chs": 16, "steam": 17}, "similarity": 0.4}
{"script": "１２月２４日（木）_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 16, "page": 0, "status": "needs_review", "speaker": {"chs": null, "steam": null}, "alt_speaker": {"chs": null, "steam": null}, "voice": {"chs": null, "steam": null, "equal": false}, "text": {"chs": "我难以避免地这么想。", "steam": "我無法克制自己這樣想。"}, "length": {"chs": 10, "steam": 11}, "similarity": 0.211}
{"script": "１２月２４日（木）_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 17, "page": 0, "status": "needs_review", "speaker": {"chs": null, "steam": null}, "alt_speaker": {"chs": null, "steam": null}, "voice": {"chs": null, "steam": null, "equal": false}, "text": {"chs": "至少，在纱凪的疼痛缓解之前，\\n绝对不能做第二回……", "steam": "至少，在紗凪的痛楚痊癒之前，我絕對不能要求第二次……"}, "length": {"chs": 26, "steam": 26}, "similarity": 0.545}
