{"script": "１２月２４日（木）_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 20, "page": 0, "status": "needs_review", "speaker": {"chs": null, "steam": null}, "alt_speaker": {"chs": null, "steam": null}, "voice": {"chs": null, "steam": null, "equal": false}, "text": {"chs": "在纱凪主动渴求之前，我还是忍着吧。\\n总觉得我这边主动要求也不好。", "steam": "在紗凪開口要求之前我應該忍耐。我不能主動要求。"}, "length": {"chs": 33, "steam": 23}, "similarity": 0.471}
{"script": "１２月２４日（木）_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 21, "page": 0, "status": "needs_review", "speaker": {"chs": null, "steam": null}, "alt_speaker": {"chs": null, "steam": null}, "voice": {"chs": null, "steam": null, "equal": false}, "text": {"chs": "要是我又失去理性变得和野兽一样，\\n然后被纱凪责备……这可不行……", "steam": "我不能又失去理性，像野獸一樣……欺負紗凪……"}, "length": {"chs": 33, "steam": 22}, "similarity": 0.444}
{"script": "１２月２４日（木）_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 22, "page": 0, "status": "aligned", "speaker": {"chs": "纱凪", "steam": "紗凪"}, "alt_speaker": {"chs": null, "steam": "紗凪"}, "voice": {"chs": "sn6770", "steam": "sn6770", "equal": true}, "text": {"chs": "「都说了。不用在意的」", "steam": "「所～以～啊～你不必在意。」"}, "length": {"chs": 11, "steam": 14}, "similarity": 0.316}
{"script": "１２月２４日（木）_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 23, "page": 0, "status": "aligned", "speaker": {"chs": "纱凪", "steam": "紗凪"}, "alt_speaker": {"chs": null, "steam": "紗凪"}, "voice": {"chs": "sn6771", "steam": "sn6771", "equal": true}, "text": {"chs": "「你要是觉得只有自己舒服而感到抱歉，\n　那作为赔礼，就是……啾……啾」", "steam": "「如果你覺得男人只負責舒服很抱歉的話，與其道歉，那個……親……親我吧。」"}, "length": {"chs": 35, "steam": 36}, "similarity": 0.302}
{"script": "１２月２４日（木）_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 24, "page": 0, "status": "needs_review", "speaker": {"chs": "新吾", "steam": "新吾"}, "alt_speaker": {"chs": null, "steam": "新吾"}, "voice": {"chs": null, "steam": null, "equal": false}, "text": {"chs": "「唔啾」", "steam": "「嗯啾。」"}, "length": {"chs": 4, "steam": 5}, "similarity": 0.5}
{"script": "１２月２４日（木）_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 25, "page": 0, "status": "aligned", "speaker": {"chs": "纱凪", "steam": "紗凪"}, "alt_speaker": {"chs": null, "steam": "紗凪"}, "voice": {"chs": "sn6772", "steam": "sn6772", "equal": true}, "text": {"chs": "「唔嗯、嗯嗯……？！啾、啾、唔唔、\\n　啾……啾唔、嗯嗯、唔……唔……♪」", "steam": "「呼嗯、嗯嗯……！？啾、啾咕、嗯嗯、啾……啾姆、嗯嗯、嗯……唔唔……♪」"}, "length": {"chs": 37, "steam": 36}, "similarity": 0.75}
{"script": "１２月２４日（木）_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 26, "page": 0, "status": "aligned", "speaker": {"chs": "纱凪", "steam": "紗凪"}, "alt_speaker": {"chs": null, "steam": "紗凪"}, "voice": {"chs": "sn6773", "steam": "sn6773", "equal": true}, "text": {"chs": "「哈……亲、亲过头啦，笨蛋……诶嘿嘿」", "steam": "「哈……太、太快了、笨蛋……嘿嘿嘿。」"}, "length": {"chs": 19, "steam": 19}, "similarity": 0.5}
{"script": "１２月２４日（木）_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 27, "page": 0, "status": "needs_review", "speaker": {"chs": "新吾", "steam": "新吾"}, "alt_speaker": {"chs": null, "steam": "新吾"}, "voice": {"chs": null, "steam": null, "equal": false}, "text": {"chs": "「……不喜欢吗？」", "steam": "「……討厭嗎？」"}, "length": {"chs": 9, "steam": 8}, "similarity": 0.0}
