{"script": "１２月２４日（木）_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 29, "page": 0, "status": "aligned", "speaker": {"chs": "纱凪", "steam": "紗凪"}, "alt_speaker": {"chs": null, "steam": "紗凪"}, "voice": {"chs": "sn6775", "steam": "sn6775", "equal": true}, "text": {"chs": "「我要是不喜欢，我也……\\n　我、我也不会把最重要的第一次交给你啊」", "steam": "「如果我會那樣想，那個……就、就不會把女孩子重要的東西給你了。」"}, "length": {"chs": 34, "steam": 32}, "similarity": 0.296}
