{"script": "１２月２４日（木）_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 31, "page": 0, "status": "aligned", "speaker": {"chs": "纱凪", "steam": "紗凪"}, "alt_speaker": {"chs": null, "steam": "紗凪"}, "voice": {"chs": "sn6776", "steam": "sn6776", "equal": true}, "text": {"chs": "「啊、唔、啾……唔呼、唔呼、\\n　又亲了……啾、嗯啾、啾、啾」", "steam": "「啊、嗯、啾……嗯呼、嗯呼、又親我了……啾咕、嗯啾、啾、啾。」"}, "length": {"chs": 31, "steam": 31}, "similarity": 0.75}
{"script": "１２月２４日（木）_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 32, "page": 0, "status": "aligned", "speaker": {"chs": "纱凪", "steam": "紗凪"}, "alt_speaker": {"chs": null, "steam": "紗凪"}, "voice": {"chs": "sn6777", "steam": "sn6777", "equal": true}, "text": {"chs": "「呼啊……嘿、嘿嘿嘿……♪」", "steam": "「呼啊……嘿、嘿嘿嘿……嗯♪」"}, "length": {"chs": 14, "steam": 15}, "similarity": 0.941}
{"script": "１２月２４日（木）_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 33, "page": 0, "status": "needs_review", "speaker": {"chs": null, "steam": null}, "alt_speaker": {"chs": null, "steam": null}, "voice": {"chs": null, "steam": null, "equal": false}, "text": {"chs": "停止接吻之后，纱凪露出无比开心的表情\\n把脸靠向了我。", "steam": "嘴唇才剛分開，紗凪就笑得一臉開心，蹭了蹭我的臉。"}, "length": {"chs": 27, "steam": 24}, "similarity": 0.217}
