{"script": "１２月２４日（木）_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 41, "page": 0, "status": "aligned", "speaker": {"chs": "纱凪", "steam": "紗凪"}, "alt_speaker": {"chs": null, "steam": "紗凪"}, "voice": {"chs": "sn6782", "steam": "sn6782", "equal": true}, "text": {"chs": "「虽、虽然这话不该由我来说，\\n　新吾，你今天不用回家吗……？！」", "steam": "「雖、雖然我沒資格說這個，不過新吾不回去沒關係嘛？」"}, "length": {"chs": 33, "steam": 26}, "similarity": 0.348}
{"script": "１２月２４日（木）_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 42, "page": 0, "status": "needs_review", "speaker": {"chs": "新吾", "steam": "新吾"}, "alt_speaker": {"chs": null, "steam": "新吾"}, "voice": {"chs": null, "steam": null, "equal": false}, "text": {"chs": "「我怎么能放着这么可爱的女友不管，自己一个人回去啊」", "steam": "「怎麼可能放著這麼可愛的女朋友回去。」"}, "length": {"chs": 26, "steam": 19}, "similarity": 0.462}
{"script": "１２月２４日（木）_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 43, "page": 0, "status": "aligned", "speaker": {"chs": "纱凪", "steam": "紗凪"}, "alt_speaker": {"chs": null, "steam": "紗凪"}, "voice": {"chs": "sn6783", "steam": "sn6783", "equal": true}, "text": {"chs": "「……哈、呜」", "steam": "「……哈、唔。」"}, "length": {"chs": 7, "steam": 8}, "similarity": 0.667}
{"script": "１２月２４日（木）_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 44, "page": 0, "status": "aligned", "speaker": {"chs": "纱凪", "steam": "紗凪"}, "alt_speaker": {"chs": null, "steam": "紗凪"}, "voice": {"chs": "sn6784", "steam": "sn6784", "equal": true}, "text": {"chs": "「这、这种说法，也不错呢……再说点……」", "steam": "「那、那樣說也、那個、很好……還要聽……」"}, "length": {"chs": 20, "steam": 21}, "similarity": 0.143}
{"script": "１２月２４日（木）_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 45, "page": 0, "status": "needs_review", "speaker": {"chs": "新吾", "steam": "新吾"}, "alt_speaker": {"chs": null, "steam": "新吾"}, "voice": {"chs": null, "steam": null, "equal": false}, "text": {"chs": "「今天樱乃住在濑名同学家里，\\n　所以不用在意那么多的」", "steam": "「櫻乃今天也會住在瀨名同學家，所以不用在意時間沒關係。」"}, "length": {"chs": 28, "steam": 28}, "similarity": 0.583}
{"script": "１２月２４日（木）_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 46, "page": 0, "status": "aligned", "speaker": {"chs": "纱凪", "steam": "紗凪"}, "alt_speaker": {"chs": null, "steam": "紗凪"}, "voice": {"chs": "sn6785", "steam": "sn6785", "equal": true}, "text": {"chs": "「这、这样啊……」", "steam": "「是、是這樣啊……」"}, "length": {"chs": 9, "steam": 10}, "similarity": 0.364}
{"script": "１２月２４日（木）_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 47, "page": 0, "status": "aligned", "speaker": {"chs": "纱凪", "steam": "紗凪"}, "alt_speaker": {"chs": null, "steam": "紗凪"}, "voice": {"chs": "sn6786", "steam": "sn6786", "equal": true}, "text": {"chs": "「……那、那干脆……如果，\\n　你愿意的话，要不……」", "steam": "「……那、那麼，乾脆……那個、新吾願意的話……」"}, "length": {"chs": 27, "steam": 24}, "similarity": 0.387}
{"script": "１２月２４日（木）_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 48, "page": 0, "status": "aligned", "speaker": {"chs": "纱凪", "steam": "紗凪"}, "alt_speaker": {"chs": null, "steam": "紗凪"}, "voice": {"chs": "sn6787", "steam": "sn6787", "equal": true}, "text": {"chs": "「一起待到……早上……？」", "steam": "「到早上……都在一起吧……？」"}, "length": {"chs": 13, "steam": 15}, "similarity": 0.714}
{"script": "１２月２４日（木）_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 49, "page": 0, "status": "needs_review", "speaker": {"chs": null, "steam": null}, "alt_speaker": {"chs": null, "steam": null}, "voice": {"chs": null, "steam": null, "equal": false}, "text": {"chs": "……瞬间，我陷入了思考。", "steam": "……我猶豫了一秒。"}, "length": {"chs": 12, "steam": 9}, "similarity": 0.286}
{"script": "１２月２４日（木）_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 50, "page": 0, "status": "needs_review", "speaker": {"chs": null, "steam": null}, "alt_speaker": {"chs": null, "steam": null}, "voice": {"chs": null, "steam": null, "equal": false}, "text": {"chs": "不过，纱凪眼里明确流露出了强烈的渴望。", "steam": "但是紗凪的眼神中散發著強烈的希望。"}, "length": {"chs": 19, "steam": 17}, "similarity": 0.303}
{"script": "１２月２４日（木）_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 51, "page": 0, "status": "needs_review", "speaker": {"chs": "新吾", "steam": "新吾"}, "alt_speaker": {"chs": null, "steam": "新吾"}, "voice": {"chs": null, "steam": null, "equal": false}, "text": {"chs": "「要好好睡觉哦」", "steam": "「如果妳乖乖睡覺的話。」"}, "length": {"chs": 8, "steam": 12}, "similarity": 0.133}
{"script": "１２月２４日（木）_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 52, "page": 0, "status": "aligned", "speaker": {"chs": "纱凪", "steam": "紗凪"}, "alt_speaker": {"chs": null, "steam": "紗凪"}, "voice": {"chs": "sn6788", "steam": "sn6788", "equal": true}, "text": {"chs": "「我睡我睡我睡！\\n　你会、会和我一起睡吧？！」", "steam": "「睡睡睡！一、一起睡覺對吧！？」"}, "length": {"chs": 24, "steam": 16}, "similarity": 0.552}
{"script": "１２月２４日（木）_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 53, "page": 0, "status": "needs_review", "speaker": {"chs": "新吾", "steam": "新吾"}, "alt_speaker": {"chs": null, "steam": "新吾"}, "voice": {"chs": null, "steam": null, "equal": false}, "text": {"chs": "「……当然」", "steam": "「……當然。」"}, "length": {"chs": 6, "steam": 7}, "similarity": 0.5}
{"script": "１２月２４日（木）_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 54, "page": 0, "status": "needs_review", "speaker": {"chs": null, "steam": null}, "alt_speaker": {"chs": null, "steam": null}, "voice": {"chs": null, "steam": null, "equal": false}, "text": {"chs": "嗯，没事的。\\n我现在能忍住。", "steam": "嗯，沒問題。我能忍得住。"}, "length": {"chs": 15, "steam": 12}, "similarity": 0.476}
{"script": "１２月２４日（木）_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 55, "page": 0, "status": "needs_review", "speaker": {"chs": null, "steam": null}, "alt_speaker": {"chs": null, "steam": null}, "voice": {"chs": null, "steam": null, "equal": false}, "text": {"chs": "不会再次失去理智了。", "steam": "不會再失去理性了。"}, "length": {"chs": 10, "steam": 9}, "similarity": 0.706}
{"script": "１２月２４日（木）_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 56, "page": 0, "status": "aligned", "speaker": {"chs": "纱凪", "steam": "紗凪"}, "alt_speaker": {"chs": null, "steam": "紗凪"}, "voice": {"chs": "sn6789", "steam": "sn6789", "equal": true}, "text": {"chs": "「啊……还能和新吾一起睡，\\n　今天已经被各种第一次填满了……」", "steam": "「哈……居然能跟新吾一起睡覺，今天真的發生好多第一次……」"}, "length": {"chs": 32, "steam": 29}, "similarity": 0.478}
{"script": "１２月２４日（木）_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 57, "page": 0, "status": "needs_review", "speaker": {"chs": "新吾", "steam": "新吾"}, "alt_speaker": {"chs": null, "steam": "新吾"}, "voice": {"chs": null, "steam": null, "equal": false}, "text": {"chs": "「都说了，已经是第二天了」", "steam": "「就說已經跨夜了。」"}, "length": {"chs": 13, "steam": 10}, "similarity": 0.235}
{"script": "１２月２４日（木）_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 58, "page": 0, "status": "aligned", "speaker": {"chs": "纱凪", "steam": "紗凪"}, "alt_speaker": {"chs": null, "steam": "紗凪"}, "voice": {"chs": "sn6790", "steam": "sn6790", "equal": true}, "text": {"chs": "「这些小细节就别管了，\\n　在睡醒之前都是今天」", "steam": "「不用管那種細節啦，到睡著醒來之前都算今天。」"}, "length": {"chs": 24, "steam": 23}, "similarity": 0.41}
{"script": "１２月２４日（木）_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 59, "page": 0, "status": "aligned", "speaker": {"chs": "纱凪", "steam": "紗凪"}, "alt_speaker": {"chs": null, "steam": "紗凪"}, "voice": {"chs": "sn6791", "steam": "sn6791", "equal": true}, "text": {"chs": "「因为是平安夜，这些事都是能被原谅的」", "steam": "「因為是平安夜，所以全部都是被允許的。」"}, "length": {"chs": 19, "steam": 20}, "similarity": 0.562}
{"script": "１２月２４日（木）_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 60, "page": 0, "status": "needs_review", "speaker": {"chs": null, "steam": null}, "alt_speaker": {"chs": null, "steam": null}, "voice": {"chs": null, "steam": null, "equal": false}, "text": {"chs": "……纱凪的心里，\\n似乎也有着平安夜的魔法。", "steam": "……在紗凪心中，平安夜似乎是有魔法的樣子。"}, "length": {"chs": 22, "steam": 21}, "similarity": 0.629}
{"script": "１２月２４日（木）_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 61, "page": 0, "status": "aligned", "speaker": {"chs": "纱凪", "steam": "紗凪"}, "alt_speaker": {"chs": null, "steam": "紗凪"}, "voice": {"chs": "sn6792", "steam": "sn6792", "equal": true}, "text": {"chs": "「就是这样，再来点、新吾再来点♪」", "steam": "「所以說，想要更多、更多新吾♪」"}, "length": {"chs": 17, "steam": 16}, "similarity": 0.296}
{"script": "１２月２４日（木）_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 62, "page": 0, "status": "needs_review", "speaker": {"chs": "新吾", "steam": "新吾"}, "alt_speaker": {"chs": null, "steam": "新吾"}, "voice": {"chs": null, "steam": null, "equal": false}, "text": {"chs": "「你真的有打算睡觉吗？」", "steam": "「妳根本就不想睡吧？」"}, "length": {"chs": 12, "steam": 11}, "similarity": 0.118}
{"script": "１２月２４日（木）_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 63, "page": 0, "status": "aligned", "speaker": {"chs": "纱凪", "steam": "紗凪"}, "alt_speaker": {"chs": null, "steam": "紗凪"}, "voice": {"chs": "sn6793", "steam": "sn6793", "equal": true}, "text": {"chs": "「呜嗷！」", "steam": "「呀！」"}, "length": {"chs": 5, "steam": 4}, "similarity": 0.0}
{"script": "１２月２４日（木）_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 64, "page": 0, "status": "needs_review", "speaker": {"chs": "新吾", "steam": "新吾"}, "alt_speaker": {"chs": null, "steam": "新吾"}, "voice": {"chs": null, "steam": null, "equal": false}, "text": {"chs": "「啊哈哈……抱歉抱歉、看见纱凪这么可爱忍不住就」", "steam": "「啊哈哈……抱歉抱歉，因為紗凪太可愛了。」"}, "length": {"chs": 24, "steam": 21}, "similarity": 0.514}
{"script": "１２月２４日（木）_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 65, "page": 0, "status": "aligned", "speaker": {"chs": "纱凪", "steam": "紗凪"}, "alt_speaker": {"chs": null, "steam": "紗凪"}, "voice": {"chs": "sn6794", "steam": "sn6794", "equal": true}, "text": {"chs": "「毕竟是平安夜，我就原谅你吧……♪」", "steam": "「因為是平安夜，所以原諒你……♪」"}, "length": {"chs": 18, "steam": 17}, "similarity": 0.56}
{"script": "１２月２４日（木）_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 66, "page": 0, "status": "aligned", "speaker": {"chs": "纱凪", "steam": "紗凪"}, "alt_speaker": {"chs": null, "steam": "紗凪"}, "voice": {"chs": "sn6795", "steam": "sn6795", "equal": true}, "text": {"chs": "「啊、疼疼疼」", "steam": "「啊、好痛痛痛。」"}, "length": {"chs": 7, "steam": 9}, "similarity": 0.364}
{"script": "１２月２４日（木）_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 67, "page": 0, "status": "needs_review", "speaker": {"chs": "新吾", "steam": "新吾"}, "alt_speaker": {"chs": null, "steam": "新吾"}, "voice": {"chs": null, "steam": null, "equal": false}, "text": {"chs": "「嗯……为了你能好受一些，\\n　无论多少次……我都会温柔地对待你的」", "steam": "「嗯……為了能盡量減緩疼痛，不管幾次……我會溫柔的。」"}, "length": {"chs": 34, "steam": 27}, "similarity": 0.311}
{"script": "１２月２４日（木）_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 68, "page": 0, "status": "aligned", "speaker": {"chs": "纱凪", "steam": "紗凪"}, "alt_speaker": {"chs": null, "steam": "紗凪"}, "voice": {"chs": "sn6796", "steam": "sn6796", "equal": true}, "text": {"chs": "「……嗯♪\\n　圣诞礼物，要给我很多哦……？」", "steam": "「……嗯♪給我很多禮物吧……？」"}, "length": {"chs": 23, "steam": 16}, "similarity": 0.522}
{"script": "１２月２４日（木）_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 69, "page": 0, "status": "needs_review", "speaker": {"chs": "新吾", "steam": "新吾"}, "alt_speaker": {"chs": null, "steam": "新吾"}, "voice": {"chs": null, "steam": null, "equal": false}, "text": {"chs": "「你这种上挑的眼神也很可爱……\\n　不过，现在能先闭上眼吗？」", "steam": "「雖然那種眼神很可愛……不過，現在閉上眼睛吧？」"}, "length": {"chs": 31, "steam": 24}, "similarity": 0.381}
{"script": "１２月２４日（木）_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 70, "page": 0, "status": "aligned", "speaker": {"chs": "纱凪", "steam": "紗凪"}, "alt_speaker": {"chs": null, "steam": "紗凪"}, "voice": {"chs": "sn6797", "steam": "sn6797", "equal": true}, "text": {"chs": "「嗯……啾、啾♪」", "steam": "「嗯……啾、啾♪」"}, "length": {"chs": 9, "steam": 9}, "similarity": 1.0}
{"script": "１２月２４日（木）_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 71, "page": 0, "status": "aligned", "speaker": {"chs": "纱凪", "steam": "紗凪"}, "alt_speaker": {"chs": null, "steam": "紗凪"}, "voice": {"chs": "sn6798", "steam": "sn6798", "equal": true}, "text": {"chs": "「嘿嘿嘿……光是今天一天，亲吻的次数就已经\\n　超过了至今以来的总数呢，感觉脑子里就只剩亲吻了呢……♪」", "steam": "「嘿嘿嘿……感覺光是今天，就超過以前加起來親親的次數了……♪」"}, "length": {"chs": 52, "steam": 31}, "similarity": 0.448}
{"script": "１２月２４日（木）_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 72, "page": 0, "status": "aligned", "speaker": {"chs": "纱凪", "steam": "紗凪"}, "alt_speaker": {"chs": null, "steam": "紗凪"}, "voice": {"chs": "sn6799", "steam": "sn6799", "equal": true}, "text": {"chs": "「今晚，在各种意义上都是一生难忘……\\n　嘿嘿、哎嘿嘿……」", "steam": "「在各種意義上都是一輩子難忘的夜晚……嘿嘿、欸嘿嘿……」"}, "length": {"chs": 30, "steam": 28}, "similarity": 0.636}
{"script": "１２月２４日（木）_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 73, "page": 0, "status": "aligned", "speaker": {"chs": "纱凪", "steam": "紗凪"}, "alt_speaker": {"chs": null, "steam": "紗凪"}, "voice": {"chs": "sn6800", "steam": "sn6800", "equal": true}, "text": {"chs": "「……新吾，你觉得怎么样？\\n　是不是也觉得……今天晚上和我在一起，一生难忘？」", "steam": "「……新吾呢？跟我一樣……一輩子都忘不了今晚嗎？」"}, "length": {"chs": 40, "steam": 25}, "similarity": 0.391}
{"script": "１２月２４日（木）_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 74, "page": 0, "status": "needs_review", "speaker": {"chs": "新吾", "steam": "新吾"}, "alt_speaker": {"chs": null, "steam": "新吾"}, "voice": {"chs": null, "steam": null, "equal": false}, "text": {"chs": "「怎么可能会忘啊」", "steam": "「怎麼可能忘記。」"}, "length": {"chs": 9, "steam": 9}, "similarity": 0.615}
{"script": "１２月２４日（木）_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 75, "page": 0, "status": "needs_review", "speaker": {"chs": null, "steam": null}, "alt_speaker": {"chs": null, "steam": null}, "voice": {"chs": null, "steam": null, "equal": false}, "text": {"chs": "——对。今天发生的事情，\\n在各种意义上都难以忘记。", "steam": "──沒錯，在各種意義上今天都是讓人無法忘記的一天。"}, "length": {"chs": 26, "steam": 25}, "similarity": 0.391}
{"script": "１２月２４日（木）_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 76, "page": 0, "status": "needs_review", "speaker": {"chs": null, "steam": null}, "alt_speaker": {"chs": null, "steam": null}, "voice": {"chs": null, "steam": null, "equal": false}, "text": {"chs": "也不能忘记。", "steam": "不可能忘記。"}, "length": {"chs": 6, "steam": 6}, "similarity": 0.6}
{"script": "１２月２４日（木）_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 77, "page": 0, "status": "aligned", "speaker": {"chs": "纱凪", "steam": "紗凪"}, "alt_speaker": {"chs": null, "steam": "紗凪"}, "voice": {"chs": "sn6801", "steam": "sn6801", "equal": true}, "text": {"chs": "「哈哈……成功了！\\n　也让新吾为我神魂颠倒了一回♪～」", "steam": "「啊哈……太好了！把新吾迷得神魂顛倒～♪」"}, "length": {"chs": 28, "steam": 21}, "similarity": 0.474}
{"script": "１２月２４日（木）_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 78, "page": 0, "status": "aligned", "speaker": {"chs": "纱凪", "steam": "紗凪"}, "alt_speaker": {"chs": null, "steam": "紗凪"}, "voice": {"chs": "sn6802", "steam": "sn6802", "equal": true}, "text": {"chs": "「哼、嘻嘻嘻嘻……哈～\\n　好开心、好幸福啊……」", "steam": "「嗯呼、嗯優嗯優嗯優……哈～太高興了、太幸福了……」"}, "length": {"chs": 25, "steam": 26}, "similarity": 0.316}
{"script": "１２月２４日（木）_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 79, "page": 0, "status": "needs_review", "speaker": {"chs": null, "steam": null}, "alt_speaker": {"chs": null, "steam": null}, "voice": {"chs": null, "steam": null, "equal": false}, "text": {"chs": "纱凪微笑着，在我眼中真是无比可爱、惹人怜爱。", "steam": "笑著這麼說的紗凪真的好可愛、好惹人憐愛。"}, "length": {"chs": 22, "steam": 20}, "similarity": 0.359}
{"script": "１２月２４日（木）_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 80, "page": 0, "status": "needs_review", "speaker": {"chs": null, "steam": null}, "alt_speaker": {"chs": null, "steam": null}, "voice": {"chs": null, "steam": null, "equal": false}, "text": {"chs": "所以我，满怀爱意抱紧了她，\\n无数次地吻她、摸她的头，让她高兴。", "steam": "所以我抱緊她，一次又一次地親吻、撫摸頭髮取悅她。"}, "length": {"chs": 32, "steam": 24}, "similarity": 0.44}
{"script": "１２月２４日（木）_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 81, "page": 0, "status": "aligned", "speaker": {"chs": "纱凪", "steam": "紗凪"}, "alt_speaker": {"chs": null, "steam": "紗凪"}, "voice": {"chs": "sn6803", "steam": "sn6803", "equal": true}, "text": {"chs": "「嗯嗯……♪呼、呼呼呼、嘻嘻嘻嘻～……」", "steam": "「嗯嗯……♪呵呵、呵呵呵、嗯優嗯優嗯優～」"}, "length": {"chs": 20, "steam": 21}, "similarity": 0.387}
{"script": "１２月２４日（木）_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 82, "page": 0, "status": "needs_review", "speaker": {"chs": null, "steam": null}, "alt_speaker": {"chs": null, "steam": null}, "voice": {"chs": null, "steam": null, "equal": false}, "text": {"chs": "然后，纱凪的身体似乎也在说着“我还要”一般，\\n更加紧贴着我……", "steam": "於是紗凪的身體便親密地貼上來，像在要求『更多』……"}, "length": {"chs": 32, "steam": 25}, "similarity": 0.261}
{"script": "１２月２４日（木）_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 83, "page": 0, "status": "needs_review", "speaker": {"chs": null, "steam": null}, "alt_speaker": {"chs": null, "steam": null}, "voice": {"chs": null, "steam": null, "equal": false}, "text": {"chs": "我们就这样紧贴着，\\n睡到了早上……", "steam": "在直到天亮為止的短暫時間中，我們依偎著彼此入睡了……"}, "length": {"chs": 18, "steam": 26}, "similarity": 0.211}
